{"name":"Ring Box Blue","hex":"#b4d9d8","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"ring","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A solid object in the shape of a circle.\nA circumscribing object, (roughly) circular and hollow, looking like an annual ring, earring, finger ring etc.","A circumscribing object, (roughly) circular and hollow, looking like an annual ring, earring, finger ring etc."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To enclose or surround.","To make an incision around; to girdle; to cut away a circular tract of bark from a tree in order to kill it."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/ring"},{"term":"box","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Symbol","definitions":["ISO 639-3 language code for Buamu."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Senses relating to a three-dimensional object or space.\n A cuboid space; a cuboid container, often with a hinged lid.","A cuboid space; a cuboid container, often with a hinged lid."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/box"},{"term":"blue","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a blue hue.","Depressed, melancholic, sad."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The colour of the clear sky or the deep sea; the colour midway between green and violet in the visible spectrum and one of the primary additive colours.","Anything coloured blue, especially to distinguish it from similar objects differing only in colour."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/blue"}],"entries":[{"title":"Box","blocks":[{"text":"A box is a container with rigid sides used for the storage or transportation of its contents. Most boxes have flat, parallel, rectangular sides. Boxes can be very small or very large and can be used for a variety of purposes, from functional to decorative."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/L%C3%A5da_-_Livrustkammaren_-_107142.tif/lossy-page1-330px-L%C3%A5da_-_Livrustkammaren_-_107142.tif.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_cont